OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue found in Oxfordshire
OL,4,Aand Isle of Wight
OL,5,
OL,6,FCases of a deadly virus affecting sheep
OL,7,Fand cattle have been confirmed in
OL,8,FOxfordshire and Isle of Wight,
OL,9,Faccording to government figures.
OL,11,FBluetongue has been found in more than
OL,12,F2,000 farm animals in the UK since July
OL,13,Fand nearly 1,200 potential cases are
OL,14,Funder investigation.
OL,16,FThe virus, which causes fever and
OL,17,Flameness, does not affect humans and is
OL,18,Fspread by midges rather than direct
OL,19,Fcontact between animals.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
